From: QQT UartScreen <noreply@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] media: cedrus: complete cancelled request controls once

vb2 calls buf_request_complete for every request-associated buffer while
__vb2_queue_cancel resets the queue. cedrus_queue_cleanup also completed the
same controls before returning the buffer, causing request_is_queued to be
cleared twice and triggering a WARN during timeout recovery.

Leave request completion to the vb2 callback on streamoff. Normal completed
decode jobs are still completed by cedrus_device_run.

--- a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus_video.c
+++ b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus_video.c
@@ -406,8 +406,6 @@ static void cedrus_queue_cleanup(struct vb2_queue *vq, u32 state)
 		if (!vbuf)
 			return;
 
-		v4l2_ctrl_request_complete(vbuf->vb2_buf.req_obj.req,
-					   &ctx->hdl);
 		v4l2_m2m_buf_done(vbuf, state);
 	}
 }
